# rate lowered (drafts/repeats/everyday.py)
scene: {N} and {partner} have been together for decades, the house has gone quiet at last, and something has woken between them that neither expected: they cannot keep their hands off each other.
scene W: {N} feels faintly scandalised, and wonders what the neighbours would say. Then again, the two of them have been together longer than the neighbours have lived there.
scene U: {N} is fascinated. Nobody ever said this could happen at their age, and {N} would like to understand why it has.
scene B: {N} spent decades putting everyone else first. The hard years are behind them, the mortgage is nearly paid, and now {N} means to enjoy every minute.
scene R: {N} feels nineteen again: giddy, reckless, laughing at nothing over breakfast.
scene G: After a long winter, the partnership has come into a late, warm season, and {N} lets it.
